{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國流行天后Ariana Grande，9月初完成全球巡迴演唱會後，宣佈暫時停工「叉電」，雖然聲明不會公開露面，不過卻三番四次被fans「野生捕獲」，Ariana日前再被拍到與舞蹈員男友Ricky Alvarez於美國紐約拍拖睇馬拉松比賽。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:23:03.934262+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:01:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:38.662968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:38.662968+00:00","content_hash":"d5e88f569fb9cc94ad3f58cf7ca5a176ab069e6ba202870179671810fdc67de8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}